OL,3,GNEWSA'No plonkers' - Stormont speaker's
OL,4,Awarning to MLAs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Assembly members
OL,7,Fshould avoid calling each other
OL,8,F"bigot", "banshee", "plonkers" and
OL,9,F"dopey", the Stormont speaker has said.
OL,11,FEdwin Poots issued the warning after
OL,12,Fthe terms were used by members during
OL,13,Ftetchy exchanges in the assembly
OL,14,Fchamber in recent weeks.
OL,16,FHe urged members of the legislative
OL,17,Fassembly (MLAs) to be "mindful of
OL,18,Fstandards of courtesy and good temper
OL,19,Fand moderation and respect".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
